Here, without any particular order, we will publish notes on the course of our
research. We will try to keep them in two languages, but the contents may
vary.

What is meaning? Where is the line between structure and semantics? What is the
role of memory in thinking? How does the process of thinking happen?
We study these and other questions in practice, peeking into the structure of
real brains and building models.

